  "title": "Cordon Bleu Salad",
  "description": "Cooked chicken, cubed ham, cubed Swiss cheese, and broccoli are tossed with a honey-Dijon dressing in this hearty pasta salad.",
  "authors": [
    "Lori Kuehl Knight"
  ],
